<title>FRANCE: TABLE-GALERIES LAFAYETTE H1 SALES FLAT.</title>
<headline>TABLE-GALERIES LAFAYETTE H1 SALES FLAT.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>     Turnover				 13,507.4  vs 13,682.8</p>
<p>	- includes Q2			  6,829.7  vs  6,858.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Galeries Lafayette gave its sales in the official bulletin BALO. Retail sales declined to 11.67 billion francs from 11.96 billion. The drop included a negative 100 million franc impact in the first half of 1997 due to a lower number of workdays and differences in the summer sales calendar and a 175 million franc negative impact due to changes in structure, it said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
